WEBVTT

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:37.690
Rosette?
Hey, Rosette, wake up! It's the phone.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.410
You get it, Chrono.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:45.420
I can't. After all, you know
how Sister Kate feels about me

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.560
Sorry, Chrono.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.260
It's all right.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.670
Hello, this is Sister Rosette!

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.970
Too slow!

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:59.240
Go to the East Side immediately!
It's an emergency!

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.080
What's the situation?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.880
They've taken
the restaurant patrons as hostages.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.590
According to the reports,
it may be a failed summoning.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.120
What about the Militia
or Sisters that are already out there?

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.420
They are currently dispatched to other cases.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.260
You are the closest to the scene!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.130
Carry out your mission as soon as you arrive!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:22.760
What?! I just finished a mission!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.600
I can't handle two missions in one night!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.370
Our order exists to serve.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:31.030
We have no time to get tired and fall asleep.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:40.270
Hey, why's Sister Kate always so angry?

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.370
Because you're always doing
things to make her angry, Rosette.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.070
You wrecked the car!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.870
She's going to get mad at you again.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.930
Chrono, you talk too much.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.370
It won't open.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.870
It's not coming open! What's going on?!

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.880
Oh dear, everyone, you're all here.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.580
And who are you two?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:28.530
I'm Rosette Christopher,
of the Magdalene Order.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.330
This is my assistant, Chrono.
Nice to meet you.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.240
That's a warrant from a federal judge.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.170
The Magdalene Order?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.590
Chrono.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.540
As of this moment,
we're taking over jurisdiction on this case.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.810
Leave the rest to us.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:50.380
I see. You're the exorcists from the Order.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.550
That's right!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:08.740
Detective, who are those children?

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.670
They're monster extermination pros.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.070
Monster extermination?!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:20.320
Rumor has it that there's an organization that
specializes in poltergeists and devil banishing,

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.370
but for them to be so young...

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.020
Chrono, can you feel anything?

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.160
This room is filled with sated gluttony.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.700
The hostages are probably already...

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.360
We're going to rush in!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.770
Ow ow ow ow, what was that? Man...

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.570
Rosette!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.080
His spiritual energy has been consumed.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.640
He had his energy rapidly
drained away, which in turn mummified him.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:00.910
Chrono!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.140
A Satanist?!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.980
A hobby of the rich.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:02.620
They want thrills, ever more dangerous thrills.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.810
He's paid a high price for playing with fire.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.430
Rosette!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.360
He's too fast!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.720
It's a waste to use
the Sacred to slow him down!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:44.880
Stop yapping!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.290
Rosette!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.350
Rosette, this isn't good!

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.010
Rosette, you did it again.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:52.260
It wasn't me!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:57.290
Oh, it's always like this!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.660
Again?!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.140
We were hoping that this time,
considering the scale of the case,

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.480
the destruction would be kept to a minimum,

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:14.280
but you always,
always surpass our expectations.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.550
I am honored to accept your praise.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.010
I am <i>not</i> praising you!

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.320
There are even complaints
from the New York City Police.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:27.300
Can't you perform your job
a little better, Sister Rosette?!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.960
I'm sorry.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.200
Or could it be the fault of your assistant?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.340
If one who lives in darkness
should call out to the darkness...

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:41.340
It has nothing to do with Chrono!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.340
It's just that I wasn't strong enough!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.250
I will submit my
written apology very soon. Excuse me.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.240
Wait, Sister Rosette!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.280
Rosette...

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:57.310
Minister Remington!

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:01.530
Wh-When did you return?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.300
Just now. More importantly,
I was able to hear you from the hallway.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.790
Another written apology?

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.540
I did it again.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:13.240
Minister! Please don't baby her!

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:16.980
And we're not finished
talking, Rosette. The devil's

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.650
I am finished talking.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.380
Well then, please look
forward to the written apology!

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.440
Rosette!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.890
That girl is only ever
truly open with you, isn't she?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.390
Let me hear your report.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.890
It isn't very pleasant, but...

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.750
Hi, Chrono!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.020
They say that Rosette has
to write another written apology!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:05.030
Well, a servant of God
completely destroyed a building, right?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.460
Oh, no, it was a whole block.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.300
What? Really?!

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.260
Oh, wasn't it an island?

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.330
What? Really?!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.340
Things must be tough for you too.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.770
Well, it happens every time, so...

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.100
"It happens every time?!"

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.870
Rosette!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:27.210
A whole block? An island?

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:31.650
You guys are blowing a person's
mistakes out of proportion for fun.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.680
Did you even see it?!

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:38.150
We definitely don't want to team up with you!

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.400
Leave me alone, will you?!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.990
I mean, really...

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.130
I feel uneasy, Minister.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.300
About him?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:57.870
No matter how tame it may look, it is...

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:01.470
He has a heart too.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.520
Can we really afford to believe in that?

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:10.850
Faith is working to affirm unseen truths.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:15.530
Or rather, perhaps it is this
uncertain era that tries one's faith.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.120
Perhaps it is because of the war.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.700
I do not think that is the only thing.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.210
But sooner or later,
they will show themselves.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.730
Until then, all we can do is wait.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:34.170
I can't even imagine what will
become of Chrono at that time.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:40.120
"We definitely don't want
to team up with you!", huh?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:43.450
I'm the one who would turn <i>them</i> down!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.160
Your hand, that's from
the holy water from before.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:01.300
But thanks to it, we were
able to defeat that thing, right?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.510
Thank you.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.050
After all, we're...

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:26.700
That's right, last night, before we
went to the East Side, I had a dream.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:42.280
The Joshua in my memory is still as he was,

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.190
even though I know that...

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.780
For me to dream about him...

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.450
It's not like you!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.260
For you to get discouraged, Rosette.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.990
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.900
What a marvelous view!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.150
Today's white
underwear is also quite brilliant!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:14.420
You perverted old man, I'll kill you!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.680
Hello, boy, are you well?

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:17.820
Yeah...

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.220
And now you're ignoring me?!

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.290
What's this?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:26.230
It's something I finished this morning.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.900
I call it the "Gospel."

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.260
Gospel?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:33.830
It's a mystical bullet that was made using
a rare silver that was created via alchemy,

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.240
and has minuscule ancient
Enochian words transcribed on it.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:40.910
Its destructive power
is much greater than the Sacred's,

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.440
which has plain old holy oil
packed inside as its explosive.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.150
It's still a test round,

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.580
and I was thinking of getting the Magdalene
Order's number one expert, Rosette,

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.290
to test fire it for me, but...

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.990
I'll do it, I'll do it, I want to do it!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.810
I've been wanting something like this!

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.790
For you to call me,
the man in charge of armaments,

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:02.530
a perverted old man,
perhaps I should rethink this matter.

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:04.600
Hearing things, you were hearing things.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.000
Don't be mean, please,
lend it to me for a little bit.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:10.300
If you let me fondle
your breasts a little, I might rethink it.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.540
Sister Rosette?

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:12.510
Who would let you fondle anything,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.640
you perverted old man!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.440
Come to her office immediately.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.680
Marching orders?
This will have to wait for another time.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.670
Stingy!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:40.000
Thank goodness.
This time we managed not to wreck the car.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.200
Chrono, you're saying too much again!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.410
Are you the Sister
from the Magdalene Order?

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.410
I've received word,
but is it just the two of you?

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.380
I'm sorry, but just a short while ago,

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.780
due to an occurrence
in Boston, we've divided our forces.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:57.980
But I will work with the effort
of ten people, so it'll be all right!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.560
Well, I guess I'll believe what you say.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.990
Right, right, they say that
those who believe will be saved!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.230
The ship is registered as being from England,

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.330
and we've lost contact with
the rescue party that went on board.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.900
Commander!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.200
It's a survivor!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.190
What did you say?!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:18.730
Save me...

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:29.050
This is wrath.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:33.120
Indescribable rage is
giving form to its actions.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:37.220
But this is...
A separate consciousness is moving it.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.990
Chrono!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.370
What are you doing?
We're going to go in with full force!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.700
Right!

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.930
Hey! Are you going to
do this, just the two of you?!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.230
Rosette, we've got to hurry!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:17.160
Chrono, get this boat
further away from the harbor!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.220
Understood, I'll try!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.340
But man, he certainly
did a number on this place.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.520
Heave!

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.840
What was this ship's cargo?

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:47.910
It's started moving!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.080
This must be it.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.060
Oh, damn!

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.930
Come on, fall down already!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.930
If it's an astral body,

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.380
then the Sacred should be enough!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.990
Rosette!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:29.060
Chrono! I'll undo the seal!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.620
You mustn't! That power
would call forth more violence!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.100
Gospel!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:37.630
Keep it a secret from Elder!

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:54.120
Bring peace to the lost lambs,

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.360
give rest to the fangs of the wolf,

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:59.290
and call the hammer of death unto the devil!

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:25.420
So, human wisdom overcomes violence?

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.360
Is that his true form?

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.790
It might be stolen.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.230
The poor thing.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:37.220
But that's still no reason to hurt people.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:39.620
Oh, no!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.250
Chrono, exactly what is going on?!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.020
Well, the boat wasn't responding to the helm,

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.350
and the engine was...

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:00.350
I'm not the bad one!

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:04.320
It's always, always, always like this!
